    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ZOyI0dWsod0HQRaRqoX7F1eILOdSEr17QrmBKOX1rBc.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\nA bar magnet has total length $2 l=20$ units and the field point $P$ is at a distance $\\mathrm{d}=10$ units from the centre of the magnet. If the relative uncertainty of length measurement is $1 \\%$, then uncertainty of the magnetic field at point P is :",
